using GameManager
using PManager

~ first_meeting
# Meeting Hein for the first time.
do mark_npc_as_met("heine")
do show("Casimir", "c_neutral", "CharacterA")
do show("Heinester", "h_default", "CharacterC")
do bounce("CharacterC")
Heinester: [wave]Wooooow!![/wave]
do shake("CharacterA")
do show("Heinester", "h_happy", "CharacterC")
Heinester: I have [b]NOT[/b] seen you in a while, Casi!
do show("Casimir", "c_smile", "CharacterA")
Casimir: ...Hi, Heine.
do show("Heinester", "h_happy", "CharacterC")
Heinester: So, Doing some outside library work? [wait=0.5]Or found a book to add to the library?
do bounce("CharacterC")
do show("Casimir", "c_neutral", "CharacterA")
Casimir: [color=#8f9ab7][i]Heine doesn’t know about the Prophet's letter yet...[/i][/color]
do show("Casimir", "c_worry", "CharacterA")
Casimir: [color=#8f9ab7][i]Do I tell him?[/i][/color]
- Don't tell the truth
	do show("Casimir", "c_flushed", "CharacterA")
	Casimir: Just wanted to see the town once in a while. I’m not that of an introvert…
	do show("Heinester", "h_conf", "CharacterC")
	Heinester: ...[wait=0.8][do show("Heinester", "h_default", "CharacterC")] [wave]Ookay?[/wave] You don’t [i]really[/i] go out just to see the town though.
	do show("Heinester", "h_happy", "CharacterC")
	do bounce("CharacterC")
	Heinester: Hey, since you’re outside, come visit right now!
	do show("Casimir", "c_shocked", "CharacterA")
	Casimir: What? [shake rate=20 level=5][b]N-Now?![/b][/shake]
	do show("Casimir", "c_angry", "CharacterA")
	Casimir: You're literally next door!
	do show("Heinester", "h_happy", "CharacterC")
	do bounce("CharacterC")
	Heinester: That’s the point! You don’t go out often, might as well visit right now, huh?
	do shake("CharacterA")
	Casimir: W-What? H-Heine–wait–!
	# Call cutscene here to pull Casimir to Heine's house...
- Tell the truth
	Casimir: How do I put this...
	do show("Casimir", "c_neutral", "CharacterA")
	Casimir: I... [i]well.[/i] I got mail.
	do show("Heinester", "h_conf", "CharacterC")
	Heinester:  Uh-huh… [wait=0.2] That’s normal, right? Almost everyone [i]but me[/i] in Cloudvale gets mail all the time.
	do show("Casimir", "c_neutral", "CharacterA")
	Casimir: …I got a letter from the Prophet.
	#Add a shocked
	Heinester: [wait=0.8]...W-Wait… [wait=0.6] you’re… you’re joking, right? [wait=0.5][do show("Heinester", "h_avert", "CharacterC")] No wait, nevermind. [b]You wouldn’t.[/b]
	# pained smile
	Heinester: So… how much time you got left?
	do show("Casimir", "c_neutral", "CharacterA")
	Casimir: ...12 hours.
	do show("Heinester", "h_sparkle", "CharacterC")
	Heinester: …Wow. Just… wow. I-I don’t know. Never thought I’d see the day where my childhood friend next door’s gonna die on who knows when.
	do show("Heinester", "h_conf", "CharacterC")
	Heinester: So… what are you gonna do now?
	do show("Casimir", "c_conf", "CharacterA")
	Casimir: …I don’t know. [do show("Casimir", "c_worry", "CharacterA")] I haven’t really given it any thought.
	Casimir: At least [b]not[/b] anything about avoiding it, surely.
	do show("Heinester", "h_frown", "CharacterC")
	Heinester: Yeah… [i]the last one[/i] didn’t get it well when they went against the Prophet’s fate.
	do show("Heinester", "h_smile", "CharacterC")
	Heinester: But thanks for telling me the truth, Casi.
	do show("Heinester", "h_default", "CharacterC")
	Heinester: Also, since you don’t know what to do yet, [b][i]I suggest you look around town one last time.[/b][/i] It’s not that bad, you know?
	Heinester: A lot of stuff’s changed in Cloudvale from the last time you probably left the library.
	do bounce("CharacterC")
	Heinester: [i]Oh![/i] I passed by the fountain in town earlier and saw [i]the smart Dragonborn![/i] We should go see him. He records a bunch of stuff about the town.
	do show("Casimir", "c_conf", "CharacterA")
	Casimir: A Dragonborn recording the town’s history? It would be nice to have a copy of his records…
	do show("Heinester", "h_mad", "CharacterC")
	Heinester:  Oh COME ON. Don’t tell me you’re thinking about adding it to your collection when you can literally turn into a pearl anytime.
	do show("Casimir", "c_flushed", "CharacterA")
	Casimir: ... [wait=0.4] I was just curious…
	do show("Heinester", "h_happy", "CharacterC")
	Heinester:  If you don’t remember since you’ve been so cooped in your library, town’s down south. Just past the red trees.
do hide_all()
=> END
